## 9. Performance & SEO

| Technique | How |
|-----------|-----|
| **Code splitting** | Next.js automatically splits pages |
| **Image optimization** | `next/image` |
| **Lazy loading** | `loading="lazy"` on images |
| **SSR/SSG** | `getStaticProps` for product pages |
| **Meta tags** | `next/head` for SEO |
| **Structured data** | JSON‑LD for products |
| **PWA** | `next-pwa` plugin |
| **Analytics** | Google Analytics, Plausible, or Segment |

---

## 10. Accessibility Checklist

- Semantic HTML (`<header>`, `<nav>`, `<main>`, `<footer>`)
- Alt text for images
- Keyboard focus styles
- ARIA roles where needed
- Color contrast ≥ 4.5:1
- Skip navigation link

---

## 11. Deployment & Monitoring

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| **Vercel** | Hosting & CDN |
| **Sentry** | Error tracking |
| **LogRocket** | Session replay |
| **Google Analytics** | Traffic insights |
| **Hotjar** | Heatmaps & surveys |

